          "sentiment": 0.0,
          "position": 133423
        },
        {
          "statement": "ies, and these agencies have been applying tighter credit standards when evaluating debt levels and future growth prospects.",
          "pattern": "future\\s+(?:growth|performance|results|outlook)",
          "sentiment": 0.0,
          "position": 138919
        },
        {
          "statement": "We believe that our brand image, awareness and reputation strengthen our relationship with consumers and contribute significantly to the success of our business.",
          "pattern": "we\\s+(?:expect|anticipate|believe|plan|intend|forecast|project)",
          "sentiment": 0.0,
          "position": 150689
        },
        {
          "statement": "We intend for these efficiencies to enable increased investments in our strategic areas of focus, which include improving broadband connectivity (for example, fiber and 5G).",
